  },
  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>När du <strong><em>Rustar Dig</em></strong>, markera ett antal ◇ nedan, på bestämda föremål eller Obestämt.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>För en <strong>lätt börda</strong> (<em>snabb &amp; tyst</em>), markera upp till 3 ◇</li>\n<li>För en <strong>normal börda</strong>, markera 4-6 ◇</li>\n<li>För en <strong>tung börda</strong> (<em>bullrig, långsam, varm, tröttar snabbt</em>), markera 7-9 ◇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">Obestämt</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"Markering 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Markering 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"Markering 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Markering 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"Markering 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Markering 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"Markering 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Markering 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"Markering 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Markering 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"Markering 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Markering 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"Markering 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"Markering 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"Markering 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"Markering 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"Markering 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"Markering 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>När du <strong><em>Har Det Du Behöver</em></strong>, flytta en markering härifrån till ett bestämt ◇ nedan.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">Utrustning</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Förnödenheter</strong> (4+Välstånd användningar ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Mer förnödenheter</strong> (4+Välstånd användningar ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Ännu mer förnödenheter</strong> (4+Välstånd användningar ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>Använd förnödenheter för att Återhämta Sig, Slå Läger eller ha extra <em>små</em> föremål.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>Kokkärl</strong> (kräver eld &amp; vatten; får Förnödenheter att räcka längre)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>Sovfäll</strong> (återfå 1d6 extra HP när du Slår Läger)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>Filt</strong> (<em>varm</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>Ombyte kläder</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>Rep</strong>, ~7,5 m</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>Spade</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>Kälke/bår/släpa</strong>, hoprullbar</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>Snöskor</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>Fackla</strong> (varar ~1 timme; <em>räckvidd</em>, <em>yta</em>, <em>farlig</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>Oljelampa</strong> (○○○ timmar, <em>nära</em>, <em>yta</em>, <em>grov</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>Extra olja</strong> (○○○○○ timmar, till lampa/lykta, oduglig som vapen)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>Ved</strong> (räcker en hel natt, <em>räckvidd</em>, <em>yta</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>Handyxa</strong>, järn (<em>hand</em>, <em>kastvapen</em>, x genomborrande)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>Klubba</strong>, järn och/eller trä (<em>hand</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>Hacka</strong>, järn (<em>nära</em>, x genomborrande, <em>vidrig</em>, <em>otymplig</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>Slägga</strong>, järn (<em>nära</em>, <em>kraftfull</em>, <em>otymplig</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>Stav</strong> (<em>nära</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>Spjut</strong>, järn (<em>nära</em>, <em>kastvapen</em>, x genomborrande)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>Långt spjut</strong>, järn (<em>räckvidd</em>, x genomborrande)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>Båge &amp; järnpilar</strong> (<em>kort</em>, x genomborrande, ○ ont om pilar, ○ slut på pilar)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>Extra pilar</strong> (x genomborrande, ○ gott om pilar, ○ ont om pilar, ○ slut på pilar)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>Kastspjut</strong>, några stycken, järn (<em>kastvapen</em>, x genomborrande, +1 skada, ○ slut på spjut)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>Sköld</strong> (+1 rustning, +1 Beredskap på 7+ vid Försvara)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>Tjocka skinn</strong> (1 rustning, <em>varm</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>Mantel</strong> (<em>varm</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">Ägodelar, föremål, byte</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Föremål\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Föremål\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Föremål\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Föremål\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Föremål\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Föremål\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Föremål\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"Plats\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Föremål\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">Övrigt</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(djur, utrustningssatser, undanstoppade saker osv.)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"Övrigt\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">Små föremål</h3>\n<p>Får plats i en ficka, pung eller stövel. När du <strong><em>Rustar Dig</em></strong>, markera lika många ☐ nedan som 4+Välstånd.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">Obestämt</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"Markering 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Markering 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"Markering 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Markering 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"Markering 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Markering 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"Markering 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Markering 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"Markering 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Markering 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"Markering 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Markering 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>När du <strong><em>Har Det Du Behöver</em></strong>, flytta en markering härifrån till föremål nedan, eller förbruka förnödenheter för att markera ytterligare ett ☐.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>Kniv eller dolk</strong>, järn (<em>hand</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>Slunga</strong> (<em>kort</em>, <em>omladdning</em>, <em>otymplig</em>, ○ ont om stenar, ○ slut på stenar)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-rushlight\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rushlight\" data-check-id=\"inv-rushlight\"> <span><strong>Sävljus</strong> (varar ~15-30 minuter, <em>hand</em>, <em>grov</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-tinderbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-tinderbox\" data-check-id=\"inv-tinderbox\"> <span><strong>Elddon</strong> (<em>långsam</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-needle-thread\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-needle-thread\" data-check-id=\"inv-needle-thread\"> <span><strong>Nål och tråd</strong></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-coppers\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-coppers\" data-check-id=\"inv-coppers\"> <span><strong>En näve kopparmynt</strong></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-whisky\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-whisky\" data-check-id=\"inv-whisky\"> <span><strong>Whisky</strong>, lägel (○○ användningar)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-awl\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-awl\" data-check-id=\"inv-awl\"> <span>Syl</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-bowstring\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bowstring\" data-check-id=\"inv-bowstring\"> <span>Bågsträng</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-chalk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-chalk\" data-check-id=\"inv-chalk\"> <span>Krita</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-charcoal\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-charcoal\" data-check-id=\"inv-charcoal\"> <span>Träkol</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-clay-jar\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-clay-jar\" data-check-id=\"inv-clay-jar\"> <span>Lerkruka</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-cloth-rag\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloth-rag\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloth-rag\"> <span>Tygstycke/trasa</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-comb\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"